 *   <li>{@link #events()} —— {@link WorkspaceModel#addListener} 桥接：{@link WorkspaceChange.Kind}
 *       映射为 {@link PortEvent.WorkspaceChanged#kind()}；返回的句柄 {@code close()} 即退订（幂等）；</li>
 *   <li>{@link #confirmer()} —— 返回构造注入的 {@link Confirmer}：卡片渲染是前端的事，
